    "text": "The relationship between 'suppression-conditional recommended mix' and 'winning' is highly susceptible to confounding by overall team strength, opponent strength, and game context, especially if 'suppression' is derived from game outcomes or defensive performance (as seen with PCI and DRtg)."
   }
  ]
 },
 "prior_work": {
  "already_answered": "no",
